        "date": "2026-11-13T14:49:52Z"
      },
      "message": "ci: cut pipeline - release gate on a self-hosted Linux runner, then tag and release\n\ncut.yml (workflow_dispatch only, runs-on [self-hosted, linux]): stage\ngate runs `cargo xtask gate release --no-snapshots` on release/vX.Y.0\nand uploads gate-logs/; stage tag, after the release PR merged, checks\nmain is the merge of the gated tip with an empty diff, tags it and starts\nthe existing release.yml on the tag (gh workflow run --ref). dry_run\ninput on both. release.yml is unchanged.\n\nxtask: `gate release --no-snapshots` drops the two Windows-golden pixel\nlanes. AGENTS.md: cut steps 2-4, Actions budget, the cut runner's\nrequirements and registration. PROCESS_VERSION 55.\n\nFixes #1413\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
