        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-13T16:45:08Z"
      },
      "message": "ci(post-merge): P2 by default, P1 only for wrong-output suites; anchored suite names\n\nThe rolling \"main is red\" issue now follows AGENTS.md \"Priorities\": P2 for a\nred gate, P1 only when a failing suite is in the script's anchored\nOUTPUT_SUITES list (golden CL/NC and recorded-post-stream suites); P0 is\nnever used. Suite names come from the FAIL rows' \"failed: tests/<name>.rs\"\nnotes and match whole names only. The open-issue search requires\nsource:agent, so a green run never closes a human-filed issue. A dispatch of\na non-main ref gets its own concurrency group.\n\nRefs #1451\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
